### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Console without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/console?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Console for a wallet that is not the principal must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/console?walletPubkey=U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Console for the principal wallet: 2xx (roleGrants + partnerShares mirrors)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/console?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build grant_studio_role without Bearer must be 401
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/grant/build
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "adminWalletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq"
}

### Build grant_studio_role as a non-principal must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/grant/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq",
  "adminWalletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}

### Build grant_studio_role for the principal: 2xx (unsigned tx for the wallet)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/grant/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "adminWalletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq"
}

### Build revoke_studio_role for the principal: 2xx
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/revoke/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "adminWalletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq"
}

### Build set_partner_share (25%, open ended) for the principal: 2xx
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/partner-share/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "partnerWalletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq",
  "shareBps": 2500,
  "startsAt": 1790000000,
  "endsAt": 0
}

### Confirm grant with a signature that was never sent on chain must be refused: 502 from the verifier, no mirror write (console stays empty)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-power/grant/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "adminWalletPubkey": "U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq",
  "txSignature": "1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111"
}
